### Create Advertisement (auto-register or login)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user": {
    "email": "alice@example.com",
    "password": "Secret123"
  },
  "ad": {
    "title": "Brand New Bike",
    "description": "A fast, lightweight bike for city rides",
    "expirationDate": "2025-12-31",
    "price": 499.99
  }
}

### Create another ad for the same user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user": {
    "email": "alice@example.com",
    "password": "Secret123"
  },
  "ad": {
    "title": "Mountain Bike",
    "description": "Durable bike for rough terrain",
    "expirationDate": "2025-12-31",
    "price": 799.99
  }
}

### Create ad with wrong password (should fail)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user": {
    "email": "alice@example.com",
    "password": "WrongPassword"
  },
  "ad": {
    "title": "Road Bike",
    "description": "Speedy bike for paved roads",
    "expirationDate": "2025-12-31",
    "price": 699.99
  }
}

### Create ad with with all the information wrong (should fail)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user": { "email": "not-an-email", "password": "" },
  "ad": { "title": "", "description": "x", "expirationDate": "2020-01-01", "price": -5 }
}



### Get all active ads
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ads

### Get all active ads with keyword filter
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ads?keyword=bike

### Get ads for a specific user (login required)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ads/my-ads
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "password": "Secret123"
}



